  "variables": {},
  "strings": {
    "en": {
      "9477d670c21348158d3a4711a0090b37.title": "Dialogue",
      "9477d670c21348158d3a4711a0090b37.text": "Once upon a time, in a time of fairytales and fables, there was an ambitious child who dreamed of a bigger life. ",
      "52c449bd9fc94f57b6aabef998870b10.title": "Dialogue",
      "52c449bd9fc94f57b6aabef998870b10.text": "A life of purpose.\nA life of wonder. ",
      "e82fd4ba505b4df78e96a6ac51a9d693.title": "Dialogue",
      "e82fd4ba505b4df78e96a6ac51a9d693.text": "But as the child grew, so too did their dream. They dreamed of a place where every stranger might have a story to tell. ",
      "ecab1c30251a497298039376e11a2f7e.title": "Dialogue",
      "ecab1c30251a497298039376e11a2f7e.text": "It was a dream so big, it seemed almost impossible to make true. Until one day, a scroll arrived. ",
      "f81e82413f7940bebdec7fe641227570.title": "Dialogue",
      "f81e82413f7940bebdec7fe641227570.text": "The scroll spoke of a distant relative. A relative the dreamer had never met. ",
      "801faa595f664de1aa4ca3b5f8de42ca.title": "Dialogue",
      "801faa595f664de1aa4ca3b5f8de42ca.text": "They had recently passed away, leaving behind a small tavern at the edge of the kingdom. ",
      "ec28173156a14fbeba5a3429d3998df9.title": "Dialogue",
      "ec28173156a14fbeba5a3429d3998df9.text": "A place where travelers came to rest. ",
      "d9c29719e69a45a489c4fc7605dfef6d.title": "Dialogue",
      "d9c29719e69a45a489c4fc7605dfef6d.text": "A place where stories were shared. ",
      "01d2bbaec0ee4871a0847801e932e9bf.title": "Dialogue",
      "01d2bbaec0ee4871a0847801e932e9bf.text": "A place where, perhaps, a dream might finally begin. ",
      "39f93f2c5527426e87004e383c2fffa0.title": "Dialogue",
      "39f93f2c5527426e87004e383c2fffa0.text": "A place also known as... ",
      "d931fa05568648c88bbd17e9b25c1192.title": "Dialogue",
      "d931fa05568648c88bbd17e9b25c1192.text": "The Wandering Mug. "
    }
  },
